TI  - The bioprospecting potential of insect venoms as antibiotics: a mini review
AN  - 41459233
DO  - 10.3389/fmicb.2025.1729786
VL  - 16
DA  - 2025
PY  - 2025
T2  - Frontiers in microbiology
J2  - Front Microbiol
SN  - 1664-302X
